OL,3,GNEWSAScotland's 32 councils could be
OL,4,Acut to six under government plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FScotland's 32 councils could be
OL,7,Freplaced by as few as six regional
OL,8,Fauthorities under proposals published
OL,9,Fby the government.
OL,11,FUnder the reforms, the regional bodies
OL,12,Fwould focus on major issues such as
OL,13,Feducation and economic growth.
OL,15,FThey would also be responsible for
OL,16,Fsupporting between 120 and 160
OL,17,Fcommunity authorities, which would
OL,18,Foversee some local issues.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
